.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE AUDIT GET"
.SH NAME
hamstik release audit get \- Download the exact saved package as JSON or a CSV ZIP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release audit get [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download the exact saved package as JSON or a CSV ZIP
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I REPORT_ID
Audit report id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --format
Package format to download
Choices: json, csv
Default: json
.TP
.B --output
Write the package bytes to this file instead of stdout (CSV ZIP)
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
